---
source: crates/kipi-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: out
---
remove repo dotfiles (store personal)
  - store personal: [repos.dotfiles]  (the next `kipi sync --all` drops it from the registries)
  - machine.toml: /srv/code/dotfiles

Dry run: would write 2 files:
--- ~/stores/personal-store/bindings.toml
+++ ~/stores/personal-store/bindings.toml
@@ -33,5 +33,2 @@
 summary = "Static site; posts in content/, theme in themes/plain"
 aliases = ["site"]
-
-[repos.dotfiles]                   # no summary yet
-remote = "github.com/example-user/dotfiles"
--- ~/.config/kipi/machine.toml
+++ ~/.config/kipi/machine.toml
@@ -19,3 +19,2 @@
 "api"             = "/srv/code/api"
 "blog"            = "/srv/code/blog"
-"dotfiles"        = "/srv/code/dotfiles"
